<title>POLAND: BWR OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 124,500.</title>
<headline>BWR OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 124,500.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.12 vs    0.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.70 vs    0.58</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.42 vs    2.31</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.75 vs    4.94</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.07 vs    2.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    6.14 vs    4.12</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 31.37 vs   18.16</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	72.81 vs   43.21</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
